      - Cabinet2Room4
  - text: And that is$.$.$. $$$$$$$the door to the next room.
    displayText: And that is... the door to the next room.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 31b5c86a24193cc45b592edca35cc68f, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.03
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 0b0000000c0000000d0000000f0000000f0000000f0000000f0000000f0000000f0000000f000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: "I wonder how much longer this dream will last. $$$$You can\u2019t have
      an infinite amount of puzzles, $$right?"
    displayText: "I wonder how much longer this dream will last. You can\u2019t have
      an infinite amount of puzzles, right?"
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bae9cd182668b904b879f7cbcdf2e654, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.03
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 2f0000002f0000002f0000002f0000005d0000005d000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: If so, $$it will get boring so fast.
    displayText: If so, it will get boring so fast.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 31b5c86a24193cc45b592edca35cc68f, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.03
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 0700000007000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: "Yeah$.$.$. So, $$to not waste more time and make you bored, $$let\u2019s
      go to the next one, $$Rika?"
    displayText: "Yeah... So, to not waste more time and make you bored, let\u2019s
      go to the next one, Rika?"
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bae9cd182668b904b879f7cbcdf2e654, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.03
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 0400000005000000060000000c0000000c00000037000000370000005100000051000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: "Okay. $$$$But maybe in the end, $$even if it\u2019s a bit boring, $$it
      might not be so bad\u2026 "
    displayText: "Okay. But maybe in the end, even if it\u2019s a bit boring, it
      might not be so bad\u2026 "
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ee76e5e7fa787224cae55b97276c9bc0, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.03
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 060000000600000006000000060000001c0000001c0000003700000037000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: "Because of this dream, $$$I can recover my precious memory with Mahiru
      after all\u2026"
    displayText: "Because of this dream, I can recover my precious memory with Mahiru
      after all\u2026"
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 31b5c86a24193cc45b592edca35cc68f, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.03
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 170000001700000017000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: "Au$.$.$. $$$Rika$.$.$. $$$Can you at least treasure me when you are with
      me? $$$$You\u2019re gonna make me sad\u2014"
    displayText: "Au... Rika... Can you at least treasure me when you are with me?
      You\u2019re gonna make me sad\u2014"
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: a7a112438f241d849b86cada18ec71c8, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.03
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 0200000003000000040000000600000006000000060000000a0000000b0000000c0000000e0000000e0000000e00000041000000410000004100000041000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: "(Rika padded Maya\u2019s shoulder.)"
    displayText: "(Rika padded Maya\u2019s shoulder.)"
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.03
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: 'Not only that. $$$$One of the reasons it might not be so bad is you. $$$$Spending
      time with you makes my life better. '
    displayText: 'Not only that. One of the reasons it might not be so bad is you.
      Spending time with you makes my life better. '
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 31b5c86a24193cc45b592edca35cc68f, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.03
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 0f0000000f0000000f0000000f00000041000000410000004100000041000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: "So, don\u2019t be sad."
    displayText: "So, don\u2019t be sad."
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 31b5c86a24193cc45b592edca35cc68f, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.03
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Ah$.$.$.
    displayText: Ah...
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 639c4c430b79fb34da6880f1d3c20f4d, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.03
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 020000000300000004000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: "(Maya\u2019s facial expression looks worried.)"
    displayText: "(Maya\u2019s facial expression looks worried.)"
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.03
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: "Let\u2019s go. $$$$The quicker we get out of here, $$the quicker we can
      go do whatever we want. $$$Maya$.$.$."
    displayText: "Let\u2019s go. The quicker we get out of here, the quicker we can
      go do whatever we want. Maya..."
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: ee76e5e7fa787224cae55b97276c9bc0, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.03
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 0a0000000a0000000a0000000a0000002a0000002a000000550000005500000055000000590000005a0000005b000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: "Yeah$.$.$. $$Let\u2019s go$.$.$."
    displayText: "Yeah... Let\u2019s go..."
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bae9cd182668b904b879f7cbcdf2e654, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.03
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Maya
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 0400000005000000060000000800000008000000100000001100000012000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: (Rika and Maya walk into the closet together.)
    displayText: (Rika and Maya walk into the closet together.)
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.03
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: (Rika glanced back at the room for a second and thought to herself. $$$$$$$$Is
      there anything else she hasn't remembered?)
    displayText: (Rika glanced back at the room for a second and thought to herself.
      Is there anything else she hasn't remembered?)
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.03
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 4400000044000000440000004400000044000000440000004400000044000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: (Friday. $$$$4th of April. $$$$Mahiru. $$$$Plum blossoms. $$$$Birthday.
      $$$$Bracelet. $$$$School stairway. $$$$Memory.)
    displayText: (Friday. 4th of April. Mahiru. Plum blossoms. Birthday. Bracelet.
      School stairway. Memory.)
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.03
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 09000000090000000900000009000000170000001700000017000000170000001f0000001f0000001f0000001f0000002e0000002e0000002e0000002e000000380000003800000038000000380000004200000042000000420000004200000053000000530000005300000053000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: (9:35 AM. $$$$Blood stains. $$$$Gift. $$$$Friend. $$$$Family. $$$$Isolation.
      $$$$Alone$.$.$. $$$$Maya$.$.$.)
    displayText: (9:35 AM. Blood stains. Gift. Friend. Family. Isolation. Alone...
      Maya...)
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.03
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 0a0000000a0000000a0000000a000000180000001800000018000000180000001e0000001e0000001e0000001e000000260000002600000026000000260000002e0000002e0000002e0000002e000000390000003900000039000000390000003e0000003f0000004000000042000000420000004200000042000000460000004700000048000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: "(Why did she even forget about Mahiru anyway?$$$$ It\u2019s this memory,
      $$$and this memory only?)"
    displayText: "(Why did she even forget about Mahiru anyway? It\u2019s this memory,
      and this memory only?)"
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.03
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 2d0000002d0000002d0000002d000000400000004000000040000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: "(Rika didn\u2019t stop her steps, $$$one of her legs entered another room
      already. $$$$Her body gradually got transported to the next room$.$.$.)"
    displayText: "(Rika didn\u2019t stop her steps, one of her legs entered another
      room already. Her body gradually got transported to the next room...)"
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.03
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 1d0000001d0000001d0000004b0000004b0000004b0000004b0000007e0000007f00000080000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: "(That\u2019s the moment she realized.)"
    displayText: "(That\u2019s the moment she realized.)"
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.03
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Something bad must have happened.
    displayText: Something bad must have happened.
    color: 1
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.03
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.733, g: 0.0667, b: 0.2157, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 
    functionCalls: []
  - text: "W-$$$Wai\u2014"
    displayText: "W-Wai\u2014"
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3497fb685e16c034e905fb6d8391ba80, type: 3}
    typeInterval: 0.03
    dialogueType: 1
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 020000000200000002000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Rika tried to cling on to the previous room, $$$but to no avail.
    displayText: Rika tried to cling on to the previous room, but to no avail.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.03
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
    characterName: Rika
    textColor: {r: 0.9098, g: 0.9255, b: 0.9333, a: 1}
    pauseIndex: 2d0000002d0000002d000000
    functionCalls: []
  - text: Because it had already started.
    displayText: Because it had already started.
    color: 0
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    typeInterval: 0.03
    dialogueType: 2
    typeSound: speak
